VALUES
  ('cs_rachel-maddow_career', 'ent_rachel-maddow', 'career', 'Career', 'Rachel Anne Maddow (  MAD-oh; born April 1, 1973) is an American television news program host and liberal political commentator. She hosts The Rachel Maddow Show, a weekly television show on MS NOW (formerly MSNBC), and serves as the cable network''s special event co-anchor. Her syndicated talk radio program of the same name aired on Air America Radio from 2005 to 2010.
