  ('cs_post-malone_career', 'ent_post-malone', 'career', 'Career', 'Austin Richard Post (born July 4, 1995), known professionally as Post Malone, is an American singer, rapper, songwriter, record producer, and actor. His music blends various genres including pop, hip-hop, trap, country, R&B, and rock. 
