  ('cs_pink_career', 'ent_pink', 'career', 'Career', 'Pink is a pale tint of red or rose, the color of the pink flower. It was first used as a color name in the late 17th century. A combination of pink and white is associated with innocence, whereas a combination of pink and black links to eroticism and seduction. 
