  ('cs_marla-maples_career', 'ent_marla-maples', 'career', 'Career', 'Marla Ann Maples (born October 27, 1963) is an American actress, television host, singer and model. She was the second wife of Donald Trump, the 45th and 47th president of the United States. They married two months after the birth of their daughter, Tiffany, in 1993. Donald and Marla separated in 1997 and divorced in 1999.',
